OL,3,GNEWSAPCSO denies passing information to
OL,4,Aattack suspect
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police community support officer
OL,7,F(PCSO) has denied passing on
OL,8,Finformation to a man suspected of being
OL,9,Finvolved in a machete attack on two
OL,10,Fvictims.
OL,12,FAlice Dobson, 30, is accused of sharing
OL,13,Fconfidential details of the police
OL,14,Finvestigation into the incident with
OL,15,FRahees Khan, 42.
OL,17,FGiving evidence she told Bradford Crown
OL,18,FCourt she had only accessed files about
OL,19,Fthe attack to see if she could
OL,20,F"develop" any leads on the case.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
