OL,3,GNEWSAPCSO denies passing information to
OL,4,Aattack suspect
OL,5,
OL,6,FDobson, from Baildon, and Rahees Khan,
OL,7,Fof no fixed abode, deny a charge of
OL,8,Fconspiracy to pervert the course of
OL,9,Fjustice, while five other defendants,
OL,10,Fincluding Khan, deny conspiring to
OL,11,Fmurder the two injured men.
